{title: Lakhon Hai Yahan Dilwale}
{artist: Mahendra Kapoor O P Nayyar}
{key: G}

{c: Verse 1}
[G] [C],        Laakho hai yahaan dilwaale,
[G] [D],        aur pyaar nahi milataa
[G] [C],        Aankho me kisi ki vafaa kaa,
[D] [C],        iqaraar nahi milataa
[G] [C],        Mahafil mahafil jaa dekhaa,
[C] [G],        har dil me samaa kar dekhaa
[C] [D] [G],        Har saaz pe gaa kar dekhaa
[C] [G],        Dil ko kahi chain naa milaa
[C] [G],        Are dil ko kahi chain naa milaa
[C] [D] [G],        Mai to duniya me pyare akela hi raha
[G] [C],        Is dil ko kahaan le jaae,
[C] [G],        kuchh aap agar faramaae
[C] [D] [G],        To aap ke ham ho jaae
[C] [G],        Kah do hame hasake zaraa
[C] [G],        Kah do hame hasake zaraa
[C] [D] [G],        Aji jo kuch bhi dil ne tumhare hai kaha
